---
import SpatialSiteHeader from '../components/SpatialSiteHeader.astro';
import { Mic, AudioLines, Volume2, Square, Headphones, ShieldCheck } from '@lucide/astro';
import '../styles/speak.css';
import '../styles/speak-v1.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<meta name="description" content="Free speaking practice with on-device hesitation detection, a red alert, and an adjustable siren. Your microphone audio stays on your device."/>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#10224a"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://speakkai.com/speak/"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/>
<title>Filler Alarm 1.0 | SpeakKai</title>
</head>
<body class="speak-page">
<SpatialSiteHeader current="resources" compact/>
<main id="speak-app">
<div class="app-heading"><div class="app-title"><AudioLines size={23}/><h1>Filler Alarm</h1><span class="release-tag">VERSION 1.0</span></div><span class="language-note"><ShieldCheck size={17}/>English · On your device</span></div>
<div class="workspace">
<section class="practice" aria-label="Speaking practice">
<div class="section-top"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR SPEAKING SPACE</p><span id="status" role="status">Ready when you are</span></div>
<div class="stage" id="stage"><div class="stage-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="stage-content">
<div class="mic-orbit"><Mic size={42} stroke-width={1.5}/></div><p class="stage-kicker" id="stage-kicker">MAKE ROOM FOR THE PAUSE</p>
<h2 id="stage-title">Speak with intention.</h2><p class="stage-help" id="stage-help">Catch hesitation sounds as you speak.</p>
<div class="level" id="level" aria-label="Microphone inactive">{Array.from({length:35},()=> <span></span>)}</div>
<div class="main-actions"><button id="start" class="primary-button"><Mic size={19}/><span>Start practice</span></button><button id="stop" class="primary-button stop-button" hidden><Square size={16} fill="currentColor"/><span>Stop</span></button><button id="test-alert" class="secondary-button"><Volume2 size={18}/>Test alert</button></div>
<p class="permission-note" id="permission-note">Allow the microphone when prompted. First start downloads about 71 MB.</p>
</div></div>
<div id="error" class="error-box" role="alert" hidden></div><div id="mic-warning" class="notice" role="status" hidden></div>
<div class="stats" aria-label="Session statistics"><div><span>SESSION TIME</span><strong id="elapsed">00:00</strong></div><div><span>FILLER SOUNDS</span><strong id="total">00</strong></div><div><span>FILLERS / MIN</span><strong id="rate">—</strong></div></div>
<section class="transcript-panel"><div class="section-top"><h2>Detected sounds</h2><span class="subtle" id="session-kind">Live practice</span></div><p id="empty-events" class="empty-events">Your detections will appear here. The model listens to your voice directly; no transcript is needed.</p><ol id="events" class="event-list" aria-label="Detected sounds"></ol><div class="transcript-footer"><span id="session-summary">Sound labels are estimates. Some hesitations may be missed.</span><button class="text-button" id="clear" hidden>Clear session</button></div></section>
<details class="clip-panel"><summary>Check a short audio recording</summary><p>Choose an English audio clip up to 60 seconds and 20 MB. It is processed locally and is never uploaded.</p><label class="file-label" for="clip">Audio recording</label><input type="file" accept="audio/*" id="clip"/><audio id="clip-player" controls hidden></audio></details>
</section>
<aside class="settings-panel" aria-label="Practice settings">
<div class="panel-heading"><h2>Make it your practice.</h2><span>01 / SETUP</span></div>
<section class="setting-group"><label for="sensitivity">Sensitivity</label><select id="sensitivity"><option value="0.7" selected>Balanced</option><option value="0.55">Catch more</option><option value="0.8">Fewer false alarms</option></select><p>Use Catch more if it misses hesitations. Choose Fewer false alarms if normal speech triggers it.</p></section>
<fieldset class="setting-group" id="sound-selection"><legend>Sounds to flag</legend><div class="sound-options"><label><input type="checkbox" value="um" checked/> um</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="uh" checked/> uh / ah</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="hmm" checked/> hmm</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="other" checked/> other hesitations</label></div><p>Exact sound names can be uncertain. Words such as “like” and “so” are not counted.</p></fieldset>
<section class="setting-group"><div class="row"><label for="siren">Siren alert</label><input id="siren" class="toggle" type="checkbox" role="switch" checked/></div><p>A short siren with each red alert.</p><div class="volume-label"><label for="volume">Volume</label><output id="volume-value" for="volume">25%</output></div><input type="range" id="volume" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="25"/><div class="row flash-row"><label for="red-alert">Red screen alert</label><input id="red-alert" class="toggle" type="checkbox" role="switch" checked/></div><div class="headphone-note"><Headphones size={16}/><span>Use headphones to keep the siren out of your microphone.</span></div></section>
<section class="setting-group"><label for="microphone">Microphone</label><select id="microphone"><option value="">System default</option></select><p id="microphone-note">Available microphones appear after you allow access.</p></section>
<details class="setting-group"><summary>Device &amp; performance</summary><label class="cpu-option"><input type="checkbox" id="force-cpu"/> Use CPU compatibility mode</label><p id="performance">Recognition runs on your device. Faster devices give quicker feedback.</p><p id="delay">Alert delay will appear after a detection.</p></details>
<div class="detection-note"><ShieldCheck size={20}/><div><h3>A practice aid, not a score.</h3><p>The model can miss fillers or flag normal speech, especially with background noise. Practice in a quiet place and compare its feedback with what you hear.</p></div></div>
</aside></div>
<footer class="app-footer"><span><AudioLines size={17}/><a href="https://desertant.com">Powered by Desert Ant Labs</a></span><p>Free, with no account or per-minute charges. Your audio stays on your device and is not saved by SpeakKai. <a href="/speech-v1/LICENSE.txt">Model license</a> · <a href="/speech-v1/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md">Credits</a></p></footer>
<div id="alert-announcement" class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><noscript><p class="error-box">Enable JavaScript to use the Filler Alarm.</p></noscript>
</main><script>import '../scripts/speak/app-v1';</script>
</body></html>
